        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Mortise Lock Cylinder for Mounting Pad</b>\r\n<p>\r\nMortise cylinder lock for interior thru-bolted mounting pad. Normally used  with concealed vertical rod panic devices to open door from exterior.  For use on doors up to 1-3/4\" thick.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWorks with <a href=\"/products/36-inch-narrow-stile-concealed-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-th1100-sted36cvr\"><b>36 Inch Narrow Stile Concealed Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-narrow-stile-concealed-vertical-rod-exit-device-global-th1100-sted48cvr\"><b>48 Inch Narrow Stile Concealed Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/42-inch-or-less-grade-2-concealed-vertical-rod-door-exit-device-dc-cvr\"><b>Crash Bar Concealed Vertical Rod Exit Device</b></a> and others that require a  mortise lock cylinder.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Global TH1100-BC-CVRPAD  Mortise Lock Cylinder for Mounting Pad\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder 5-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Lock Body Length: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cam: Adams Rite (A/R) Cam</li>\r\n<li> Solid Brass Cylinder</b>\r\n<li>Mounting Pad Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Pad Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe set includes mortise lock cylinder, mounting pad, lock nut, 1-7/8\" long thru-bolts and 2 keys.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>Available in aluminum or dark bronze finish.\r\n</p>",
